    "summary": "US B1/B2 visitor visa under INA. B1 (business) or B2 (tourism). Visa-required for most nationals; ESTA (VWP) for eligible countries. Key: overcome presumption of immigrant intent (INA Â§214b) by showing ties to home country.",
