      }
    ]
  },
  "source_notes": [
    "B1/B2 fee: $185. Interview required at US embassy/consulate. Check wait times at travel.state.gov.",
    "Visa Waiver Program (ESTA $21, 2 years): UK, most EU, Australia, Japan, South Korea, Singapore, Chile, etc.",
    "Canada/Bermuda citizens: generally visa-exempt for visits.",
    "Â§214(b) INA: every B1/B2 applicant presumed intending immigrant. Must prove otherwise.",
    "NO published minimum bank balance. Evidence of ties (job, family, property) matters more.",
    "Passport typically 6 months beyond stay. Check country-specific agreements.",
    "DS-160 online form is mandatory for all B1/B2 applicants."
  ],
